Error [jet.SocketOperationNotOnTarget]: `core.net.unix_listen` is not available for target `wasm32-wasip2`.
  --> Tests/UI/wasip2_unsupported_socket_operation_e3305.jet:2:10
    |
  2 | use net: core.net
    |          ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The selected target has no Prelude adapter for `core.net.unix_listen`; WASI Preview 2 provides TCP/UDP sockets but not this operation. A `jet build` or `jet run` run reports this target-support diagnostic.
 Fix: Use a supported TCP/UDP operation, or build for a native target.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3305
